  "[action] goes to see father",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I should have been here to greet you, Father, and I am sorry I did not come sooner.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung answers his eldest son with irritation.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I will not ask you what you did with the money, and I will not ask you where you went, and I will not ask you what you were doing with your wife and with your child.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung is puzzled by his son's behavior.",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung answers his eldest son shortly.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and why not?\"",
  "[action] The second son enters the room suddenly.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and here I am to greet you too. It seems to me this is not fair that you should go and you do not come back, and I have not a thought of you, but you have a wife and you have a son and you are my father and I will see you often.\"",
